1
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,950
The Instruments tab lists every instrument your broker offers, grouped by type.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:09,360
Right-click an instrument for its chart, a price alert, or an order.

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,080
In the detail panel, click the pivot method to choose another formula.

4
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:14,600
Pick Classic, Woodie, Camarilla, Fibonacci or DeMark.

5
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,460
The levels are worked out again with the new formula.

6
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,970
Six more columns are hidden as standard. Right-click a heading and choose Customize.

7
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:29,970
Tick MaxVol, the rollover columns, ImmD, Trade Step and NT Interval.

8
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:33,970
They now appear as columns. Customize again hides them.

